 pub const SubmitError = error{ Closed, Busy };
 
+/// What a backend hands the server for its round-profile print (TF_DS_ROUND_PROFILE): the served process's copy of
+/// what the batch driver's --profile prints. The metrics handler calls `print` after the reply; the family owns the
